                 <string>&lt;html&gt;&lt;head/&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;Number of ensemble states to propagate to resolve 99.9% of the partition function.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Note: this can be much lower than the actual number of states in a thermal ensemble. However, due to symmetry, not all ensemble memebers needs to be propagated.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
