            <item>
             <widget class="QLabel" name="label_42">
              <property name="toolTip">
               <string>&lt;html&gt;&lt;head/&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;Without focal volume averaging, also indicate the distribution of populated J states with &amp;lt;J&amp;gt; and &amp;lt;J&amp;gt;±sqrt(&amp;lt;J&lt;span style=&quot; vertical-align:super;&quot;&gt;2&lt;/span&gt;&amp;gt;-&amp;lt;J&amp;gt;&lt;span style=&quot; vertical-align:super;&quot;&gt;2&lt;/span&gt;).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The J value J&lt;span style=&quot; vertical-align:sub;&quot;&gt;99.9%&lt;/span&gt;, below which 99.9% of the probability amplitude is found, is also plotted.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
              </property>
              <property name="text">
               <string>&lt;html&gt;&lt;head/&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;If #FVA shells is 1, also plot extra&lt;br/&gt;information about the wave function.&lt;br/&gt;(hover mouse here for more information)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
              </property>
